WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.176
Hi! I'm Bruno. I have a lot of plans for this weekend!

2
00:00:05.626 --> 00:00:08.644
On Saturday morning, I'm going to walk in the park.

3
00:00:09.094 --> 00:00:10.766
I'm going to relax a lot!

4
00:00:13.016 --> 00:00:16.592
In the afternoon, my friends and I are going to go to the beach.

5
00:00:17.042 --> 00:00:19.178
We're going to hang out and play volleyball.

6
00:00:21.428 --> 00:00:24.679
On Sunday, we're going to have lunch with my grandparents.

7
00:00:25.129 --> 00:00:27.730
My grandma is going to cook her famous lasagna!

8
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:32.720
And my sister? She isn't going to go out.

9
00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:36.235
She's going to binge-watch series and eat chocolate!

10
00:00:38.485 --> 00:00:40.528
It's going to be a great weekend!

11
00:00:40.978 --> 00:00:43.811
And you? What are you going to do this weekend?

